and, by a standard density argument, the above holds for all $\varphi \in H^1(\mathbb{T}^2)$. In turn, by bounding the relevant terms and arguing as per \eqref{eq:as per remark attainment old} in Remark \ref{rem:attainment old}, we deduce 
