\end{equation*}
by \eqref{eq:comparing norms rho t attainment}. Thus $\Vert \rho(t) \Vert_{L^2} \to \Vert \rho_0 \Vert_{L^2}$ and $\rho(t) \rightharpoonup \rho_0$ in $L^2$, whence \eqref{eq:conv rho to initial data} follows.

